    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d811">

                <pb facs="0828" n="822" sameAs="frus:frus1942v02/pg822"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">740.00119 European War 1939/1042</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Memorandum of Conversation, by the Secretary of
                        State</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">[<placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>,] <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1942-06-12">June 12, 1942</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>The Prime Minister<anchor n="97" xml:id="d811-f1"/> and the Minister of
                        Greece<anchor n="98" xml:id="d811-f2"/> called and handed me some documents
                    (copies attached<anchor n="99" xml:id="d811-f3"/>) relative to the views and
                    attitude of Greece with respect to certain problems which appropriately would
                    come up at the end of the war. I thanked him and said that I would receive them
                    solely as information at present and not from the standpoint of giving
                    consideration to them at this time.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>C[<hi rendition="#small-caps">ordell</hi>] H[<hi rendition="#small-caps"
                            >ull</hi>]</signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d811-f1" n="97" xml:id="d811-f1-content">
                <p>Emmanuel J. Tsouderos.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d811-f2" n="98" xml:id="d811-f2-content">
                <p>Cimon P. Diamantopoulos.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d811-f3" n="99" xml:id="d811-f3-content">
                <p>The memorandum <hi rendition="#italic">infra</hi>, and its attachments (not
                    printed).</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
